  "content": "<h2>回饋與問題回報</h2><p>發現錯誤或有建議嗎？<br>\n歡迎加入我們的社群，在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/NG8vuDekTT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Discord</strong></a> 上與我們交流！</p><hr><h2>與朋友同樂！</h2><h3>如何開始</h3><ol>\n<li>前往 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdathost.net%252fr%252ftalhanation%252fminecraft-server-hosting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>透過我的連結使用 DatHost</strong></a></li>\n<li>註冊您的帳號。</li>\n<li>註冊完成後，選擇符合您需求的方案</li>\n<li>結帳時，<strong>30% 折扣將自動套用</strong>。<strong>重要提醒：</strong> 折扣僅在您透過此 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdathost.net%252fr%252ftalhanation%252fminecraft-server-hosting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">**我的連結**</a> 訂購伺服器時生效！</li>\n</ol><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdathost.net%252fminecraft-server-hosting%253fref%253dtalhanation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d6ec0353-37bd-4f09-a427-694da9f8c500\" alt=\"DatHost\"></a></p><hr><h2>我的其他模組</h2><h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvillager-recruits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/20dc335a-fdcd-4075-a317-4047c040a020\" alt=\"recruits-icon\"></a></h3><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvillager-recruits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>村民招募</strong></a>：<br>\n指揮您的<strong>村民軍隊</strong>投入戰爭！現已加入<strong>外交與陣營系統</strong>！</p><hr><h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvillager-workers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/talhanation/wiki/assets/10392726/7b2f12d9-793a-491f-ba0a-c91bc3bf9e2c\" alt=\"workers-icon\"></a></h3><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvillager-workers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>村民工人</strong></a>：<br>\n雇用村民，讓他們<strong>為您工作</strong>！</p><hr><h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsmall-ships\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/talhanation/wiki/assets/10392726/1c579ef7-61a9-404a-bd37-99be59930b5b\" alt=\"smallships-icon\"></a></h3><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsmall-ships\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>小型船隻</strong></a>：<br>\n駕駛<strong>您自己的可航行船隻</strong>探索海洋！</p><hr><h2>使用權限</h2><p>您可以在任何模組包中使用小型船隻模組，只要您附上本頁連結，且不從模組包中獲利。</p><hr><h2>主要網站</h2><p>請造訪 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsmall-ships\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Modrinth</strong></a> 上的詳細頁面，以獲取關於小型船隻的更多資訊！</p>",
